WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:05.580
What's up guys!

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.520
We are Pongfinity

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.740
Today we will play glow in the dark ping pong

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.440
This is by far the most requested thing on our channel to do

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.280
So we are finally doing it!

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.760
We have bought a few UV lamps

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.100
And then we got tapes

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.720
We don't know if this works at all

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:20.840
But we are going to try it out!

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.340
This is so exciting to try something like this

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.820
I'm really looking forward to seeing how this will look!

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.180
So we have the table ready

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.320
Emil, lights!

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.940
Oh yeah! This looks cool!

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:44.780
Wow!

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:48.320
This is way better than I ever imagined it to be!

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.700
It's time to give Emil some make up

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.180
I seriously think the face paint is a bad idea

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:55.960
There we have

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.620
Emil's war painting

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.640
Looking good!

00:00:58.860 --> 00:00:59.800
Paint me beautiful

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.360
Don't paint my hair

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.160
How much are you putting?

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.640
Emptying the whole bottle on my face!

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.980
I'll paint Otto eyebrows

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.640
That didn't work very well...

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:13.200
This looks great

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:14.260
I like those!

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.660
And then something on the nose as well

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:19.200
Otto looks like a mouse!

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.060
I need to put whiskers!

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:24.600
He looks like a cat!

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.200
So we are making ourselves glow in the dark 

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.620
That's so good

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:30.840
We need more of this

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:34.560
This sticks a bit better on my hands than Otto's hands!

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:35.660
I wonder why

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.520
Do I look like a stick figure?

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.680
This looks just like a movie!

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.560
I mean, it's way too good to be true!

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:46.620
I think we should tape Otto's beard

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.260
I don't think so!

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.300
I think we are ready to start!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.780
You actually can play surprisingly well here

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:09.120
Yeah, I'm surprised

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:51.000
Almost!

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:56.760
Victory dance!

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:29.900
Guys if you wanna see more crazy videos like this

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:31.880
Do consider hitting subscribe!

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.760
Okay maybe it's time to stop this!

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.120
It's clearly 5 AM!

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:51.700
Okay I think this was one of the coolest things we have ever done on our channel!

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:52.200
Yeah

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:54.400
And if you guys enjoyed it as much as we did

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.060
Remember to go and hit subscribe!

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:58.760
Also, leave a like if you want to see a part 2!

00:03:58.760 --> 00:03:59.860
Until next time!

